{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":55169,"duration_api_ms":54757,"num_turns":16,"result":"I rewrote the existing `/CLAUDE.md` instead of making a new one. I haven't run any of the build or run commands in it. I took them from the Makefiles, the CI workflows and the directory layout.\n\nWhat I added:\n- **Setup:** the `blazesym` and `bpftool` submodules must be initialized, or every libbpf build fails. I also listed the build dependencies.\n- **Two build flows:** about 26 examples have a Makefile and build with libbpf. The early ones (such as 1–10 and 20) are built with `ecc`/`ecli`.\n- **Build commands:** how to build a single example, how to use the master `src/Makefile`, and how CI smoke-tests with `sudo timeout -s 2 3`. There is no unit-test suite.\n- **Makefile architecture:** the build pipeline (libbpf → bpftool → clang → skeleton → user space) and that every Makefile is a copy of one template, so a build change has to be repeated in each one.\n- **Docs conventions:** every tutorial has an English and a Chinese README, and `generate_toc.py` depends on the `<number>-<name>` directory naming.\n\nI kept the directory groupings from the old file. I did not check them against each example's contents.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ce59589a-a2b8-48ef-a35e-68c4aa4b769a","total_cost_usd":0.26565374999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":22,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17705,"cache_read_input_tokens":329080,"output_tokens":6698,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":17705},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":404,"cache_read_input_tokens":41281,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2219,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2219,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":22,"out